sequence-diagram

User [icon: user, color: blue] > ChatPage [icon: monitor, color: blue]: Submit message
ChatPage > NextBff [icon: server, color: purple]: POST /api/chat with UIMessage and workspace snapshot
NextBff > DjangoSse [icon: radio, color: purple]: POST /chat/stream
activate DjangoSse
DjangoSse > ChatGraphRunner [icon: workflow, color: purple]: run_stream(message, session_id, metadata)
ChatGraphRunner > ThreadContext [icon: history, color: gray]: activate session
ChatGraphRunner > LangGraph [icon: route, color: purple]: astream ChatTurnState
activate LangGraph
LangGraph > MainAgent [icon: brain, color: violet]: invoke main_agent
activate MainAgent
MainAgent > MainLlm [icon: brain-circuit, color: yellow]: generate answer
alt [label: facts needed] {
  MainAgent > ToolRegistry [icon: plug, color: green]: get main_agent tools
  ToolRegistry > RagOrExternalMcp [icon: plug-zap, color: green]: RAG or external tool call
  RagOrExternalMcp --> ToolRegistry: tool result
  ToolRegistry --> MainAgent: evidence or warning
}
MainAgent --> LangGraph: AI message stream
deactivate MainAgent
LangGraph > MainResult [icon: file-output, color: violet]: extract final_response
MainResult --> DjangoSse: agent.text.final
LangGraph > ScreenControlAgent [icon: panel-top, color: violet]: final_response plus frontend state
activate ScreenControlAgent
ScreenControlAgent > WorkspaceTools [icon: panel-right, color: teal]: call one workspace surface tool
WorkspaceTools --> DjangoSse: workspace command custom event
deactivate ScreenControlAgent
LangGraph > SpeechTextAgent [icon: message-circle, color: violet]: convert answer for TTS
activate SpeechTextAgent
SpeechTextAgent > SanitizeLlm [icon: brain-circuit, color: yellow]: concise Korean speech text
SanitizeLlm --> SpeechTextAgent: final_response_script
SpeechTextAgent --> DjangoSse: speech_text.final
deactivate SpeechTextAgent
LangGraph > TtsNode [icon: volume-2, color: orange]: stream_speech(script)
activate TtsNode
TtsNode > ElevenLabs [icon: audio-lines, color: yellow]: TTS streaming request
ElevenLabs --> TtsNode: audio chunks
TtsNode --> DjangoSse: tts.audio.chunk and tts.completed
deactivate TtsNode
deactivate LangGraph
DjangoSse --> NextBff: SSE event stream
deactivate DjangoSse
NextBff > AiSdkStream [icon: radio-receiver, color: "#2563eb"]: convert to UIMessage parts
AiSdkStream --> ChatPage: text, trace, audio, workspace command
ChatPage > WorkspaceReducer [icon: panel-right, color: "#2563eb"]: validate and apply command
WorkspaceReducer --> ChatPage: render one active surface
ChatPage --> User: answer, audio, map or checklist surface
